{
  "sn45.8:0.1": "Linked Discourses 45.8 ",
  "sn45.8:0.2": "1. Ignorance ",
  "sn45.8:0.3": "Analysis ",
  "sn45.8:1.1": "At Sāvatthī. ",
  "sn45.8:1.2": "“Mendicants, I will teach and analyze for you the noble eightfold path. ",
  "sn45.8:1.3": "Listen and apply your mind well, I will speak.” ",
  "sn45.8:1.4": "“Yes, sir,” they replied. ",
  "sn45.8:1.5": "The Buddha said this: ",
  "sn45.8:2.1": "“And what is the noble eightfold path? ",
  "sn45.8:2.2": "It is right view, right purpose, right speech, right action, right livelihood, right effort, right mindfulness, and right immersion. ",
  "sn45.8:3.1": "And what is right view? ",
  "sn45.8:3.2": "Knowing about suffering, the origin of suffering, the cessation of suffering, and the practice that leads to the cessation of suffering. ",
  "sn45.8:3.3": "This is called right view. ",
  "sn45.8:4.1": "And what is right purpose? ",
  "sn45.8:4.2": "The purpose of renunciation, good will, and harmlessness. ",
  "sn45.8:4.3": "This is called right purpose. ",
  "sn45.8:5.1": "And what is right speech? ",
  "sn45.8:5.2": "Refraining from speech that’s false, backbiting, harsh, or nonsensical. ",
  "sn45.8:5.3": "This is called right speech. ",
  "sn45.8:6.1": "And what is right action? ",
  "sn45.8:6.2": "Refraining from killing living creatures, stealing, and unchastity. ",
  "sn45.8:6.3": "This is called right action. ",
  "sn45.8:7.1": "And what is right livelihood? ",
  "sn45.8:7.2": "It’s when a noble disciple gives up wrong livelihood and ear